# Accepted risks for the trivy scan in .github/workflows/security.yml. Each entry names one finding, why it is
# acceptable, and an expiry after which the scan fails again so the decision is revisited. Keep this list short.

# zod 3.25.76 (CVE-2023-54404, denial of service via unbounded array validation). Reached only through
# expo -> @expo/cli, which declares zod ^3.25.76 and uses it for dev-server plugin schemas on a developer's
# machine. It is not shipped in the app and does not validate input from users or the network. zod 3.25.76 is the
# last 3.x release; the fix is in zod 4.x, which @expo/cli does not support. Revisit when Expo moves to zod 4.
CVE-2023-54404 exp:2027-01-22
